message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "Pordenone: a deterministic validation kernel, simulated telemetry, and a 3D research dashboard"
type: software
authors:
  - name: Vers3Dynamics
repository-code: "https://github.com/topherchris420/resonate-ai-mesh"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-21"
abstract: >-
  Research software that validates agent proposals with a deterministic
  epistemic kernel, publishes simulated telemetry, and renders the result on a
  3D dashboard. Typed judgment is optional and off by default. The stack does
  not actuate physical systems.
